{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>Heart</b> — because he mentioned that he was born in sin. The meaning: the desire planted within brought him to sin; let him pray to HaShem that He help him against his inclination, that he not sin again such a sin — and this is a pure heart." "<b>And a steadfast spirit</b> — the meaning is doubled."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 51, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:31:33.151217204Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}